    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/09c61d07f3d783427321a15d187d94e9.poster.avif?t=1727482877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/09c61d07f3d783427321a15d187d94e9.webm?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/09c61d07f3d783427321a15d187d94e9.mp4?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>ABOUT THIS GAME</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Z After is a survival hidden objects game with zombies, guns and you guessed it, survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/a799152f524b48e1bdc00139fff86da5.poster.avif?t=1727482877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/a799152f524b48e1bdc00139fff86da5.webm?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/a799152f524b48e1bdc00139fff86da5.mp4?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through seven stages of hand-drawn areas in a narrative-driven storyline to figure out your role in the zombie apocalypse. Gather weapons, ammo, and armor to help defend yourself in a turn-based tactical combat phase which will allow you to gather materials and fortify buildings to help thwart the oncoming horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/b7a32a7eb6b41e0cfca6d0d559335c15.poster.avif?t=1727482877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/b7a32a7eb6b41e0cfca6d0d559335c15.webm?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/b7a32a7eb6b41e0cfca6d0d559335c15.mp4?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock multiple characters with unique talents that make each playthrough a different experience altogether.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\t100+ individual pieces of gear to find (common, uncommon, rare). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\t100+ interactive objects with layers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tUnique, hand-drawn exterior/interior interactive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tExploration and Battle phases. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tOriginal soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tMultiple characters with concurrent storylines that lead up to a surprise ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tRandomly generated item locations for great replayability.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/09c61d07f3d783427321a15d187d94e9.poster.avif?t=1727482877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/09c61d07f3d783427321a15d187d94e9.webm?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/09c61d07f3d783427321a15d187d94e9.mp4?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>ABOUT THIS GAME</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Z After is a survival hidden objects game with zombies, guns and you guessed it, survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/a799152f524b48e1bdc00139fff86da5.poster.avif?t=1727482877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/a799152f524b48e1bdc00139fff86da5.webm?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885840/extras/a799152f524b48e1bdc00139fff86da5.mp4?t=1727482877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through seven stages of hand-drawn areas in a narrative-driven storyline to figure out your role in the zombie apocalypse. Gather weapons, ammo, and armor to help defend yourself in a turn-based tactical combat phase which will allow you to gather materials and fortify buildings to help thwart the oncoming horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu